				<u>Fr.</u>
				166
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				436d
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπουδῇ χ.</span>
			<i>to jest</i> in earnest, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
